_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T14:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:32:58Z","body":"Sadly this seems to break the DAP (for use with external debuggers), so we're reverting this for 4.6 to restore the functionality: #115208.\r\n\r\nFeel free to attempt another fix for the two issues linked here that wouldn't regress for the DAP (maybe @rsubtil would be able to help ensure it).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778448930/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3779213555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114457#issuecomment-3779213555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114457","id":3779213555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hQjjz","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T16:06:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T16:06:57Z","body":"@kbieganski I have tested a different approach: https://github.com/rsubtil/godot/commit/b5379de609cc9a682c4970dd053b2c29e0636337. Basically, if the `EditorDebuggerServer` is valid, stop and notify all script debuggers; otherwise, only \"silently\" stop the script debuggers.\r\n\r\nThis fixes the issue on DAP, but I don't know if it fixes the original issues since I can't replicate them either.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3779213555/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]